Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There is an overwhelming\Ndifference in fighting ability
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,between us and the evil gatherers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But we must not give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our goals are not the same as other groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are here to collect the coins,\Nnegotiate with the alien,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and put an end to this silly game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.79,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We need every last ally we can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.33,0:00:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we really trust her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.45,0:00:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she's dangerous, she--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...to our new member.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"A few days earlier"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.41,0:02:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get my phone number?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You were being blackmailed\Nby a monster named Sudo, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you one of his friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, I've got something I think you'll like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.45,0:02:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to hang up for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... If possible,\NI'd like to join your group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.33,0:03:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to join these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what their goal\Nis in gathering the coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want information.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you tell them about Sanbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.45,0:03:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked him directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.70,0:03:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I vowed to help you two\Nafter I witnessed your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.41,0:03:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lay my life on\Nthe line for you and Shuichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have no reason to help some random group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great, huh?\NHe seems to like you quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It suits me fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.83,0:03:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, right now I just want some\Npieces to move around the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's what I need them for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair, do you think your sister is there?\NUp in the mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.50,0:04:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think she has allies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She was speaking with someone on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister said she was the one\Nthat turned me into a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.58,0:04:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She also said that she was supposed\Nto be the one inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she mean by that?\NWhat is she trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think you and I\Nmet by coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a coincidence. Remember what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"We were brought together by destiny."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then, mind going\Nback to your normal form?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.08,0:05:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.83,0:05:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?\NYou never mentioned this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone that joins our group\Nmust enter into a special pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.95,0:05:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A special pact?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,To complete it, we'll need you\Nto return to your normal form, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to, that's fine.\NBut you can't join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.33,0:05:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll we do, Clair?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I will enter the pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.95,0:06:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I am the only one who will do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.83,0:06:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.58,0:06:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike all of you,\NI don't have a secret to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.54,0:06:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And my normal life isn't at\Nrisk of being destroyed at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.75,0:06:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm a normal human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The gatherer is this costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.83,0:06:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They change into a costume\Nand put someone inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange, I've never\Nseen one like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I will enter your "pact."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are trustworthy, I will have\Nthis boy enter the pact, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Can a normal human enter the pact, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair! It's okay, I'll go too--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Just leave it to me. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:07:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people stay the same\Nwhen they transform, huh? I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.45,0:07:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're wearing a mask. Others were too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,One had a helmet. Another was wearing a sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's to hide their faces, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,One wasn't hiding his face though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. He looked that\Nway after transforming, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he's just some ugly guy that\Ntransforms into someone handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Can... Can I pet you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.16,0:07:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So... How does this pact work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.33,0:07:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We make you vow to protect our secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I already heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly am I supposed to do...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly? Well... To put it simply...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the power to make people keep secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.00,0:08:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka! Stay away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you freaking out about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.29,0:08:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's fine, he looks pretty silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus you're the one that brought them here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute! It's so soft...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she doing? How am I supposed to react?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought. You're a very kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell the truth...\NI can understand animals' feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.29,0:08:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... I'm a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mean thing to say.\NYou wanted to join us, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me I was going\Nto enter a pact to keep secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, why did you take off your clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,An outsider was able to force their way in--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you say for sure\Nthat your secret is still safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If I was one of those evil gatherers,\Nyou'd all be dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.91,0:09:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't actually an\Nacquaintance of Ikeuchi's, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.12,0:09:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to him?\NDid you blackmail him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you blackmail him into bringing you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't know how many of us\Nthere are or what kind of powers we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.45,0:09:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to start a fight\Nwith a group you know so little about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.66,0:09:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Ikeuchi told me\Nwhat powers you all have?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:10:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not possible.\NI know, because he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean he'll die if he reveals your secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.83,0:10:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate people that don't keep secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you're the one who's hard to trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a gatherer--\Nwhy are you collecting coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.54,0:10:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How does getting close\Nto us fit in to your plot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, fine, it's not like\Nit's something to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I go get my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.87,0:10:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--You're so cute cute cute cute cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.33,0:10:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--Uh... Could you...?\N--You're so cute cute cute cute cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.62,0:10:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...cute cute cute cute cute cute cute--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair! Did you finish the pact?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet. Could you give me my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:11:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're looking for her.\NShe's a monster, like you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She killed my parents and\Nturned the boy with me into a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to find her, and--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Elena Aoki, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You know my sister?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.41,0:11:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You're Elena's younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess there is some resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.29,0:11:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to tell me!\NIs she in these mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then... I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're very clever.\NAnd you're not shaken easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.45,0:11:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention being beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you join us, I will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I will begin the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't really look any different\Nfrom a normal human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And with your power to make people keep secrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.87,0:12:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you're unlike any monster I've faced before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not everyone has some kind of complex\Nin regards to their appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Suffering from the spirit,\Nfrom relationships, is much more common.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in love with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.87,0:12:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They were a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That person had had a strong moral compass--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,they were troubled by our relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and eventually withdrew from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a fool--I talked\Nto my best friend about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking I could trust her to keep our secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate people that can't keep secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.00,0:12:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that teacher a man? Or a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.29,0:13:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So with your nose, you can\Npick up any scent? Like a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Animals sure are incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I'm a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since they went back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you do for this pact?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.20,0:13:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I can't say. That would\Nbe giving away my friend's secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to answer any questions\Nyou have about me though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking about yourself\Ndoesn't count as revealing a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... So, why did you\Ndecide to start gathering coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:14:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... I'm not interested in the amazing\Npowers that the alien talks about, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that power ends up in the hands\Nof someone who really wants it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be worried about what'd happen\Nto my school and my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.83,0:14:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It was scary to think about--\NI had to do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird, huh? A weak coward like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.79,0:14:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She is the same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She knows how weak she is,\Nbut she can't abandon others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She seems to be having a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you said you have a\Nreally good sense of smell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it help you find things you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so, if I know what it smells like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually kind of lost\Nmy wallet in the mountains here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it have your ID in it or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it did. So if a bad person finds it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.41,0:15:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't have much stamina\Neven when I transform.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.20,0:15:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Are you transformed right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.45,0:15:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't seem any different\Nfrom a normal person...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a little different. Don't laugh, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.87,0:15:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that!\NI just like animals, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.45,0:15:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be a vet when I get older!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.62,0:15:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted to\Nbe able to understand them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but I never actually wanted to be one myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That alien was just having fun at my expense!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:16:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! But I'm going\Nto look for your wallet alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no good! It's my wallet, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to find the wallet\Nmore quickly alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.66,0:16:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to hurry and\Nfind it before someone else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, if you come along,\Nyour scent will throw me off track.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what if I went inside you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if I'm inside\Nmy scent won't get out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.62,0:16:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I'm in there, I won't slow you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.83,0:16:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? Will she--\Nwill your girlfriend get mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:16:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I mean, Clair isn't\Nmy girlfriend or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:17:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But your clothes will get dirty, and, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.95,0:17:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.37,0:17:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.25,0:17:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this where you get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.95,0:17:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but... stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.83,0:17:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.20,0:17:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move. This is the best option we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to leave me behind in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.29,0:17:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.08,0:17:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.95,0:17:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try moving slowly to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! It doesn't feel like my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.12,0:18:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine, just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll move, you can just sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like it was with Clair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so easy for her, from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're thinking about her now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I can sense your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.87,0:18:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, when you think of her, it's--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:19:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No! You've got it wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So... Is this part of the "ceremony"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.20,0:19:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not as though I don't like people like you.\NLove takes many forms...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.91,0:19:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think we know\Neach other well enough for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll begin the official ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.75,0:19:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a choker woven from my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.79,0:19:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to wrap it around your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It'll meld with your body,\Nand nobody will be able to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it will still be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.58,0:20:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So? How does it protect your secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.79,0:20:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If you reveal our secrets
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,or somehow feel yourself\Nthat you've betrayed us,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,the choker will respond to your feelings\Nand cut your head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.29,0:20:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power is so specific--not like\Nany of the other monsters I've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.33,0:20:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The difference is that I had\Na clear vision of what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Those without a clear vision\Ntransform into something
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,that can grant their subconscious wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually listened to what the alien said--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I formed a vision, told him what I wanted,\Nand this is how I transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.37,0:20:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,To make those who reveal secrets\Npay for what they've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.79,0:20:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to make sure... You do have\Ninformation on my sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.08,0:20:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Go ahead, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.25,0:21:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put your clothes in the helmet\Nand hide them, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If we take them with us,\Nthe scent will get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Underwear?!\NAre you completely naked in there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But you said my clothes would get dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you dumb?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.08,0:21:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not dumb! It's just a crazy situation, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who feels happy about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are! I can sense your feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stop messing around,\Nwe need to find your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.29,0:22:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Subaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just found this wallet. Must be my lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Episode 7: Metamorphosis"
